# Compiled output of the Node auth/static server (server/*.ts -> server-dist/*.js).
# `dist` above does NOT cover this: gitignore matches path segments whole, so
# `dist` never matches the segment `server-dist`. Verified with
# `git check-ignore -v frontend/server-dist`, which returned nothing until
# this line existed.
